{%- comment -%}
  "Not sure of your size?" — sits directly under the variant picker, because
  sizing doubt is the single most common reason a ready buyer walks away.

  There is no Sizing Guide page. If you want this block, point it at an on-page
  anchor such as #sizing-faq so the customer stays on the product page, or leave
  it off the template entirely — the sizing FAQ row already covers the question.

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} the main-product block
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
  <p class="sw-sizing-help-wrapper" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}
      <a href="{{ block.settings.link }}" class="sw-sizing-help">
        {%- render 'stridewell-icon', icon: 'ruler', class: 'sw-icon--sm' -%}
        <span>{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</span>
      </a>
    {%- else -%}
      <span class="sw-sizing-help">
        {%- render 'stridewell-icon', icon: 'ruler', class: 'sw-icon--sm' -%}
        <span>{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</span>
      </span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
